     1	"""06-views.md step 7: one re-judging round. Open views whose reading changed are judged in dependency order, each
     2	once; a view whose conclusion changed adds its open dependants. The model reads the evidence in force (with each
     3	replaced predecessor), the dependencies' current conclusions and its own last conclusion (for comparison only).
     4	Code checks every citation and that a rung move or a first judgement says changed; one retry, then the item fails.
